# --- GO. GPU offload ----------------------------------------------------------

# The ids match ubuntu.md's GO section. GO1-GO3 (OpenMP offload with p2996,
# clang 23, GCC 16) cannot exist on the Mac: no Apple GPU target, no
# libomptarget on macOS. GO4-GO7 are AdaptiveCpp's Metal backend and chipStar.
